
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In the garage, there is a box that contains a great many boxed copies of these games. This includes all the documentation, media, and random toys they used to include when they released these games. I will not likely play any of these, but I am glad they exist. (p.s. I can&#8217;t imagine these would exist without the help of the robots) </p>


